        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 101.75,
          "end": 103.93,
          "en": "to all the reuse, this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 103.93,
          "end": 107.22999999999999,
          "en": "And this, shows us this re-usability of components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 107.22999999999999,
          "end": 108.47,
          "en": "We're using the card,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 108.47,
          "end": 110.19,
          "en": "in various places of the app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 110.19,
          "end": 111.45,
          "en": "We're using the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 111.45,
          "end": 113,
          "en": "in different places of the app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 113,
          "end": 115.5,
          "en": "And we only defined these components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 115.5,
          "end": 116.97999999999999,
          "en": "and their styles once.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 116.97999999999999,
          "end": 119.16,
          "en": "And we can build our entire UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 119.16,
          "end": 121.42,
          "en": "with these reusable building blocks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 121.42,
          "end": 122.91,
          "en": "That's really the heart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 122.91,
          "end": 124.25,
          "en": "and the core idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 124.25,
          "end": 127.043,
          "en": "or one of the core ideas of react.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 127.89,
          "end": 130.17,
          "en": "So, we got the button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 130.17,
          "end": 131.31,
          "en": "and hence the footer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 131.31,
          "end": 133.11,
          "en": "We can add such a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 133.11,
          "end": 134.36,
          "en": "and say, okay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 134.36,
          "end": 136.18,
          "en": "or something like that on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 136.18,
          "end": 139.55,
          "en": "So that this is our closed modal button in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 141.02,
          "end": 142.92000000000002,
          "en": "Now, between the H two tags here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 142.92000000000002,
          "end": 144.46,
          "en": "I wanna have some title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 144.46,
          "end": 145.293,
          "en": "And of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 145.293,
          "end": 148.89,
          "en": "that modal should be configurable from outside.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 148.89,
          "end": 150.46,
          "en": "I don't wanna hard code, the title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 150.46,
          "end": 152.55,
          "en": "and the message into this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 152.55,
          "end": 154.53,
          "en": "It should also be reusable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 154.53,
          "end": 155.55,
          "en": "So that we can use it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 155.55,
          "end": 157.12,
          "en": "in different places of the app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 157.12,
          "end": 159.253,
          "en": "to show different error messages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 160.29,
          "end": 163.12,
          "en": "Hence here, I, I'll put something dynamic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 163.12,
          "end": 164.5,
          "en": "between curly braces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 164.5,
          "end": 167.123,
          "en": "and use, let's say props.title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 167.97,
          "end": 169.48,
          "en": "Again, it's your component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 169.48,
          "end": 171.82999999999998,
          "en": "You can use any prop name you want here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 171.82999999999998,
          "end": 174,
          "en": "but I expect to get a title prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 174,
          "end": 174.836,
          "en": "which holds the text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 174.836,
          "end": 176.683,
          "en": "which should be output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 177.73,
          "end": 179.13,
          "en": "Now between the paragraphs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 179.13,
          "end": 181.94,
          "en": "I want to output props.message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 181.94,
          "end": 184.8,
          "en": "So that we also expect a message prop which,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 184.8,
          "end": 185.715,
          "en": "well, holds the message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 185.715,
          "end": 187.215,
          "en": "that shouldn't be output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 189.02,
          "end": 191.48,
          "en": "And I also want some styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 191.48,
          "end": 192.313,
          "en": "For data attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 192.313,
          "end": 196.14,
          "en": "to find the errormodal.module.CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 196.14,
          "end": 196.973,
          "en": "And you can, again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 196.973,
          "end": 199.81,
          "en": "just drag that into your UI folder next",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 199.81,
          "end": 201.68,
          "en": "to the error modal JS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 201.68,
          "end": 203.55,
          "en": "and then import it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 203.55,
          "end": 207.12,
          "en": "Import classes from ./ErrorModal.module.CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 210.9,
          "end": 213.67000000000002,
          "en": "Because I'm also using CSS modules here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 213.67000000000002,
          "end": 215.82,
          "en": "to have unique class names.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 215.82,
          "end": 216.81,
          "en": "And there are a couple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 216.81,
          "end": 218.91,
          "en": "of classes that should be attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 218.91,
          "end": 220.28,
          "en": "For example here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 220.28,
          "end": 221.84,
          "en": "on the card itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 221.84,
          "end": 225.59300000000002,
          "en": "I wanna add the classes.modal class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 226.45,
          "end": 227.65,
          "en": "Which is one of the classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 227.65,
          "end": 229.803,
          "en": "to find here in the CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 231.24,
          "end": 233.39,
          "en": "In addition on the header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 233.39,
          "end": 238.163,
          "en": "I want to have the classes.header class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 239.01,
          "end": 240.36,
          "en": "And on that div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 240.36,
          "end": 242.3,
          "en": "that's surrounds the paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 242.3,
          "end": 246.423,
          "en": "I will add the classes.content class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 248.16,
          "end": 249.34,
          "en": "On the footer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 249.34,
          "end": 250.59,
          "en": "we'll also add a class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 250.59,
          "end": 253.84,
          "en": "and that's the classes.actions class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 253.84,
          "end": 256.83,
          "en": "And these are all CSS classes predefined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 256.83,
          "end": 258.39300000000003,
          "en": "in that CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 259.97,
          "end": 263.52,
          "en": "With that, we'll have a basic modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 263.52,
          "end": 264.67,
          "en": "and we can already see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 264.67,
          "end": 266.13,
          "en": "that in action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 266.13,
          "end": 266.963,
          "en": "The question is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 266.963,
          "end": 269.08,
          "en": "where do we wanna render it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 269.08,
          "end": 271.84,
          "en": "as part of which component?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 271.84,
          "end": 274.88,
          "en": "And you can actually argue about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 274.88,
          "end": 276.14,
          "en": "You can argue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 276.14,
          "end": 277.2,
          "en": "that it should be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 277.2,
          "end": 278.79,
          "en": "inside of add user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 278.79,
          "end": 281.65999999999997,
          "en": "because ultimately it will be this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 281.65999999999997,
          "end": 283.93,
          "en": "that will trigger the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 283.93,
          "end": 285.39,
          "en": "You could also argue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 285.39,
          "end": 287.35,
          "en": "that it's a general overlay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 287.35,
          "end": 289.03,
          "en": "over the entire UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 289.03,
          "end": 290.55,
          "en": "and therefore logically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 290.55,
          "end": 292.57,
          "en": "it should be rendered as high",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 292.57,
          "end": 295.02,
          "en": "as possible in the component tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 295.02,
          "end": 295.98,
          "en": "Something like inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
